					"content": "我跟迪希雅一起去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130241103,
					"content": "#欸？沒必要把{F#妳}{M#你}捲進來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪希雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241104,
					"content": "#{M#他}{F#她}很厲害的哦，迪娜澤黛，這種事如果{M#他}{F#她}和迪希雅聯手，絕對「哐噹」一下就解決了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241105,
					"content": "#這…好吧，有{M#他}{F#她}在，我確實會放心一些。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241106,
						130241107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241106,
					"content": "放心好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241108
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130241108,
					"content": "#那我在城裡等{F#妳}{M#你}們的消息，{F#妳}{M#你}們一定要安然無恙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪娜澤黛"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241109,
					"content": "謝謝妳，小姐，能這麼關心我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪希雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241110,
					"content": "那走吧，先去喀萬驛見見「熾光獵獸」，我的兄弟們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "迪希雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 130241107,
					"content": "我…我盡量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130241108
					]
				}
			]
